  unitName: Gaston (Omni)
  unitId: 850368
  unitNumber: 8230
  description: A flamboyant battle partner from another world, Gaston's loud actions
    often shroud his keen eye for strategy. The truth is that even when stranded
    in an alien world, his ability to form sound tactics--coupled with his trademark
    stubbornness--served to keep him and his companions out of trouble. Yet he realized
    there was still much to learn, and before leaving the odd land he had found himself
    in, he intended to know as much as possible about these new kinds of demons...
  summonDesc: Fear has no place here! <br>Evildoers, begone!
  fusionDesc: Well, keep it coming!<br>We don't have all day!
  evoDesc: Stop gawking and hand me my weapon!<br>There's no time to waste!
